1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
This cockroach can fire a needle.

2
00:00:02,167 --> 00:00:03,400
And a person holding a remote

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,000
decides when it shoots.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,633
Scientists strapped a tiny launcher

5
00:00:06,633 --> 00:00:08,067
onto a living cockroach,

6
00:00:08,067 --> 00:00:09,367
then used electrical pulses

7
00:00:09,367 --> 00:00:10,500
to steer it.

8
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,333
A second cockroach

9
00:00:11,333 --> 00:00:12,400
carries a camera,

10
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,533
letting the operator watch

11
00:00:13,533 --> 00:00:15,400
as the first moves into position.

12
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,467
Once it lines up,

13
00:00:16,467 --> 00:00:17,900
they fire the injector.

14
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,000
They’ve demonstrated this

15
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,600
on laboratory targets.

16
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,833
But the plan is to send them

17
00:00:21,833 --> 00:00:23,333
beneath collapsed buildings,

18
00:00:23,333 --> 00:00:25,267
carrying emergency medicine.

19
00:00:25,267 --> 00:00:26,400
So if you’re trapped

20
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:27,233
and something starts

21
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:28,533
crawling toward you…

22
00:00:28,633 --> 00:00:29,700
you might actually want it

23
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:30,933
to get closer.
